Freight Coordination

We work with trusted forwarders for sea and air freight. Competitive rates and reliable transit times to Hong Kong.

Accepted Trade Terms
FOB
Free On Board. Supplier delivers to port, we handle freight and insurance from there.
CIF
Cost, Insurance & Freight. Supplier arranges shipping to destination port.
EXW
Ex Works. We collect from your facility. Best for suppliers who prefer minimal handling.
DAP
Delivered At Place. Supplier delivers to our designated facility, import cleared by us.
